//   বাণিজ্যিক is an explicit member) — exact-name matches, entered;
//   দোকান/চান্দিনা is never mapped to বাণিজ্যিক anywhere else.
// - Zero-engine-rate rows (Muradnagar 1, Debidwar 1) stay as entries
//   with rates:{} (in the table, no lookup rate), batch-2 precedent.
